{
  "id": "502301",
  "resourceId": 23,
  "name": "德爾塔：怪盜忍者",
  "skin": "預設",
  "spineVersion": "4.0",
  "skel": "c023_00.skel",
  "atlas": "c023_00.atlas",
  "defaultAnimation": "idle",
  "interactions": [
    {
      "id": "voice_01",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_01.mp3",
      "text": "對忍者來說，\n最重要的就是隱密、術法、\n對情況的判斷力和合作能力。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_02",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_02.mp3",
      "text": "雖然我只是怪盜見習生，\n但我相信身為忍者的自己，\n造詣已達到很高的境界。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_03",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_03.mp3",
      "text": "怪盜之道和忍者之道。\n唯有能同時踏上這兩條道路之人，\n方可稱作怪盜忍者。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_04",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_04.mp3",
      "text": "我會特地將我所學的全部術法\n傳授給指揮官。\n所以您要不要也一起成為怪盜忍者呢？",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_05",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_05.mp3",
      "text": "我的手裏劍絕不會扔向指揮官。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_06",
      "category": "在大廳點擊時（好感度10）III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_06.mp3",
      "text": "能與指揮官一起踏上怪盜忍者之路，\n真是我的榮幸。忍忍！",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_07",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時",
      "audio": "voices/voice_07.mp3",
      "text": "如果要等指揮官，\n我是否能在天花板內等您呢？\n一直站在這裡，不太符合忍者之道。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_08",
      "category": "在大廳閒置時（好感度10）I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_08.mp3",
      "text": "在天花板內看不太到指揮官的容顏。\n我決定在此等候。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_09",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_09.mp3",
      "text": "……！您是怎麼找到我的？\n我明明已經像影子般行動了啊。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_10",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_10.mp3",
      "text": "正義怪盜團要集合了嗎？\n我馬上去。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_11",
      "category": "在前哨基地點擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_11.mp3",
      "text": "我已經送出預告信了。\n今晚午夜見。",
      "animation": "action"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_12",
      "category": "初次見面",
      "audio": "voices/voice_12.mp3",
      "text": "我是見習怪盜忍者，德爾塔。忍忍！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_13",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_13.mp3",
      "text": "我可以更隱密、更安靜地行動。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_14",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_14.mp3",
      "text": "可以學的忍術變多了。我這就去修練。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_15",
      "category": "戰鬥力提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_15.mp3",
      "text": "感謝您的支援，我會試著開發新的忍者武器。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_16",
      "category": "禮物I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_16.mp3",
      "text": "這不是用忍術製造的幻影，而是真的嗎？\n……真的很感謝您。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_17",
      "category": "禮物II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_17.mp3",
      "text": "會為我準備這些東西的，就只有指揮官了。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_18",
      "category": "禮物III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_18.mp3",
      "text": "為了回報您，我會讓正義怪盜團聲名遠播的。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_19",
      "category": "好感度提升I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_19.mp3",
      "text": "……我的心跳聲太大了。\n很難悄悄地行動。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_20",
      "category": "好感度提升II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_20.mp3",
      "text": "我會全力以赴，\n希望有一天能正式加入正義怪盜團，\n與指揮官並肩而立。",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_21",
      "category": "好感度提升III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_21.mp3",
      "text": "辦公室……不，團內戀愛是被禁止的嗎？",
      "animation": "shy"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_22",
      "category": "編隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_22.mp3",
      "text": "見習怪盜忍者，準備完畢。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_23",
      "category": "在野外點擊部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_23.mp3",
      "text": "忍忍！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_24",
      "category": "在野外移動部隊",
      "audio": "voices/voice_24.mp3",
      "text": "絕不能發出腳步聲。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_25",
      "category": "進入戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_25.mp3",
      "text": "發現敵人，正在悄悄接近中。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_26",
      "category": "開始戰鬥I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_26.mp3",
      "text": "忍術，戰鬥開始！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_27",
      "category": "開始戰鬥II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_27.mp3",
      "text": "我這就展現修練的成果給您看。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_28",
      "category": "開始戰鬥III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_28.mp3",
      "text": "我不會留下任何痕跡。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_29",
      "category": "換彈I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_29.mp3",
      "text": "手裏劍，回收完畢。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_30",
      "category": "換彈II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_30.mp3",
      "text": "忍術，換彈！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_31",
      "category": "換彈III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_31.mp3",
      "text": "我先隱於暗影之中。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_32",
      "category": "可使用爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_32.mp3",
      "text": "忍術，準備就緒。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_33",
      "category": "爆裂技能",
      "audio": "voices/voice_33.mp3",
      "text": "密技！忍者超速運作！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_34",
      "category": "全爆裂",
      "audio": "voices/voice_34.mp3",
      "text": "我會展現正義的力量給您看！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_35",
      "category": "消滅敵人I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_35.mp3",
      "text": "正義，執行完畢。",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_36",
      "category": "消滅敵人II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_36.mp3",
      "text": "忍忍！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_37",
      "category": "消滅敵人III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_37.mp3",
      "text": "精準命中了！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_38",
      "category": "被擊I",
      "audio": "voices/voice_38.mp3",
      "text": "呃……！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_39",
      "category": "被擊II",
      "audio": "voices/voice_39.mp3",
      "text": "咳呃！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_40",
      "category": "被擊III",
      "audio": "voices/voice_40.mp3",
      "text": "忍……！",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_41",
      "category": "無法戰鬥",
      "audio": "voices/voice_41.mp3",
      "text": "果然……\n身為見習怪盜忍者，還是有太多不足之處……",
      "animation": "idle"
    },
    {
      "id": "voice_42",
      "category": "戰鬥勝利",
      "audio": "voices/voice_42.mp3",
      "text": "這點程度，就算是見習怪盜忍者也能辦到。",
      "animation": "idle"
    }
  ]
}